WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:06.610
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.800
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.390
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.940
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.940
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.340
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.900
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.520
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.210
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.990
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:44.650
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:49.360
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.630
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:56.000
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.770
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.910
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:06.850
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:09.650
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.890
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:16.190
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:22.720
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:34.070
<i>No.I7 enters the stadium,
leading the race! Look at No.I7 go!</i>

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:37.240
<i>Fast, fast, he's very fast!
Ethiopian runners are incredible!</i>

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.100
<i>How are the japanese runners?
Yes, yes, l see theml I see them!</i>

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:43.970
Say, Dad? When I grow up,
can I be in the Olympics, too?

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:48.820
Of course you can. Anyone can be in
the Olympics if they try hard enough.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:49.880
Oh!

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:54.020
<i>Here he comes! He crosses the finish
line! And he did it'! The gold medal!</i>

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:16.150
<i>All special members, please
assemble at the designated area.</i>

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.250
<i>l repeat...</i>

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.620
THE SECRET ASSEMBLY CALL!

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.220
Idiot!

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.920
Secret call?

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.290
What's that?

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:30.930
Oh, you know. That's what they called P.A.
announcements at Bancho's old school.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.490
(ls that what we called them?)

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:35.870
Right?! I suddenly need
to relieve myselfl

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.640
Come on, Bancho!
Let's go together, like men!!

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.710
Shun Ukiya, here as ordered, sir!

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.130
Chotaro Banba is here!

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.920
You two are late!

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:54.370
More important, what kind
of an incident is it?

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.940
I have summoned you
for only one reason.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:02.380
According to Intelligence investigation,
we have spotted a new gate keeper.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.580
What? We have another ally?

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:07.240
This gate keeper has
mastered the gate-ability...

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.840
...of substantially increasing
personal physical strength.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:14.360
Oh, my... So it's a
strong gate keeper!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.590
Huh, so l have a rival!

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.890
No. You're out of our league,
and you know it.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:23.360
So, our current mission is
to go scout this new ally?

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.600
What is the location?

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:28.930
I hope it's Kyushu.
I've never been there.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.070
Hokkaido was delicious!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.070
- Right here.
- Huh?

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:45.950
A physically strong gate keeper with
that slim build? Don't make me laugh.

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.960
I'll administer the entrance test.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:52.660
Double Inner Circle throw!!

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.320
What do you think you're doing?!?

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.370
What the?!

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.760
<i>A w- woman?</i>

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.510
Allow me to introduce you.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.340
I'm Kaoru Konoe.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:39.700
Her gate has been designated
the "The Gate of Pursuit."

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:55.990
SPEEDOMETER

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:13.040
The energy guided from the gate
increases her athletic ability...

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:17.710
...giving her power and speed
far surpassing human limitations.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:22.050
The Gate of Pursuit.
That's really far-out!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:25.710
She should be much more reliable
than a certain reckless somebody.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.220
Who do you mean by that?

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.090
Who knows?

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:33.290
It will be great to have
someone like her as an ally.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:34.720
Actually...

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:38.600
Oh, I only came here because
they wanted to take records.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:42.830
You're the so-and-so keepers, right?
I don't intend to participate.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.970
What?!

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.100
Your family is also under
financial stress, huh?

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:51.180
I understand perfectly.
You're worried about your family, right?

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.150
I was just like
that, too, at first.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:57.480
But I realized that doing
Earth defense work is...

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.150
...kind of stupid.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:01.210
Yes, it is kind of
stupid, isn't it...?

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:02.760
HUH?

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:07.660
All this stuff about Earth Defense
and invaders sounds so unreal.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:11.550
But invaders really do exist.
Besides, how do you explain your power?

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:16.050
It's not like I ever
wanted this power.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:20.730
Besides, I'm going to quit
school soon and seek employment.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:26.060
I don't have time to play
with you and your little fantasy.

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:31.180
N... No fair!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.920
Here it comes!

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:42.410
An unreal little fantasy, huh?

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:46.460
Does this mean I'm
fantasizing my injuries, too?

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:52.060
Kaoru Konoe,
born on july 31st, 1953.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.970
Admitted into a private high school
in Kanagawa for her exceptional skills...

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.100
...with expectations of future
track and field athlete stardom.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:01.340
She took the record
in the 100 meter dash...

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.110
...in a meet this May
at the 8 second mark.

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:05.740
Hold on a second.

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:10.810
8 seconds?! Even Hayes barely made it
under 10 seconds at the Tokyo Olympics...

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:14.150
I see, it's the power of the gate.

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:18.680
Of course. Her record was
never officially approved...

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:21.560
...and she voluntarily
resigned from the track team.

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:25.390
I doubt it was voluntary.

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:28.990
Yes. I think she found
it hard to stay on the team.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.840
It seems there were a
lot of rumors about her.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:36.570
She can still run without
using the gate power.

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:41.940
Have you forgotten?
Even you use gate power unconsciously.

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:45.190
You made a normal car
go 300 km per hour.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.820
It's the same.

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:56.160
The harder she tries, the harder
it is to contain the gate power.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:08:00.670
Kaoru must really have
run hard at the meet.

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:05.830
It's ironic. The harder she tries,
the farther away her dream becomes.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:10.880
What a deplorable fate!!!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.980
Take that!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.040
Oops.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.050
Hey, where are you hitting that?

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.140
You made the Olympic Team turn pale!

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:28.190
<i>This is search chopper 303.</i>

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:32.200
<i>Still unable to locate the
target in the metro highway loop.</i>

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:35.170
<i>Continuing surveillance. Over!</i>

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:38.500
Where? Where is he lurking?!

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:44.250
Do you mean the UGO, commander?

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.540
Yes. a UGO...

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:50.350
...in other words, an
unidentified ground object.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:52.680
This UGO has been
undertaking various...

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:56.210
subversive activities on the
metro highway since last week.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:59.060
However, we haven't even been
able to reveal its nature.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:05.630
It's such a shame...
We could really use the Gate of Pursuit.

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:09.140
Right now, we need all the
combat strength we can get.

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:13.130
Still, what do you suppose
is the invaders' objective?

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.040
I don't know.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:19.540
They targetted youths in
West Shinjuku, then a concert...

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:22.640
...a salt field, and now they're
after the metro highways.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.440
The invaders' objective...
their very acting principle...

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:28.850
"remains shrouded in mystery.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.890
Or perhaps...
...Ms. Ochiai!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.560
Did you realize
something, Commander?!

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.360
Is it possible?!
Could this be...?!

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:42.200
Oh. I'm sorry, Commander.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.470
I forgot you don't
like instant coffee.

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:46.640
Fight!
Yeah!

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:51.570
You actually want to
continue running, don't you?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:56.140
I'm sorry, but we were
asked to look at your data.

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:59.150
You're going home to your
family tomorrow, aren't you?

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:03.650
If you're interested, would you
like to transfer to Tategami High?

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:06.990
You might not be able to formally
compete in a track meet though.

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:10.230
Please don't get the wrong idea.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:14.670
I was watching them, not
because I'm jealous or anything...

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:18.630
...but because I think that
they're wasting their time.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.180
Wasting their time?

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:24.270
No matter how hard you try,
what's hopeless is hopeless.

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:27.440
You can't defeat someone
who's undefeatable...

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:31.010
...even if you try your whole life.
Sol was wondering why they even try.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.380
Th- That's no way to talk!

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:36.480
In my case, I came first
in any athletic activity...

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.580
...ever since elementary school.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:43.800
Now that I look back on it,
it was the power of the gate.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.370
But I think that's the
same as being gifted.

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:52.370
Some are born naturally smart.
Some are born naturally fast.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:55.100
You can't beat naturals like me
no matter how hard you try.

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:58.970
What?! And we were nice enough
to give you a chance out of pity!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:02.920
So, you think you can't be
bested physically by anybody?

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:03.980
That's right.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.920
All right, I challenge you!

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:08.750
What?!

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:12.920
In exchange, if I win, you have
to join the Gate Keeper team!

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.760
But you can't beat me.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:19.360
We'll see.

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:31.550
That makes 21 times.

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:37.750
It's not... over yet.

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.320
Do you want to continue?

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.410
Of course... sss...

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:46.590
Ukiya!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.060
Oh, my. He's in bad shape.

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:50.860
Pull yourself together, man!

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.400
Miss Konoe,
you overdid it a little!

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:55.700
Yeah! This is too horrible!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:58.740
In that case...

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:03.540
...then don't waste your breath
in the first placel!

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.450
Hey, wait!

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:09.050
- Let her go.
- But...

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:14.650
She had to quit track
because of her power...

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.430
...and we're shamelessly
trying to draw out that power.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:24.160
So... let her go, Rurippe.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:26.970
Ukiya...

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.070
...l keep telling you...

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:33.270
...not to call me Rurippe!

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.470
I'm hurt there!!!

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:44.110
<i>This is 307. We are still unable
to locate traces of the UGO.</i>

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.790
What's wrong?

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:28.230
There appears to be an accident.
This is a newly opened highway.

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:29.960
It was bound to...

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.470
What the heck are those?!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:37.230
Paranormal frequencies registered!!!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:40.270
Which means, those are invaders!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.810
Those?!

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:47.850
They outwitted us!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:52.080
The unidentified ground object,
the UGO that has been trashing...

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:56.110
...the metro highway, has
appeared on the Tomei highway!

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:59.120
Oh, my! They're all crushed!

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.500
Are those slabs invaders?!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:06.500
Yes. The enemy was camouflaged
as the road itself...

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.560
...staying hidden from the
eyes of the search choppers.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:12.940
At this rate, Japan's great artery,
the Tomei highway...

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:15.570
...will be destroyed
beyond recognition.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:17.470
To save the people!

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.540
To protect the newly opened
Tomei highway!

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:23.580
Head out, Gate Keepersfl

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:26.080
Roger, AEGIS!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.760
Come, everyone, hurry!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:04.220
Miss Konoe!
The children, quickly!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.760
Roger!

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.170
You'll have to do
better than that!

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:20.940
They're stronger than I am?!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.240
Arrow of light!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.280
Vacuous missile!!

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:31.580
Ukiya and...

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:32.710
...lkusawa!

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.920
Go while you can, Kaoru!

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.620
This is our job as
the Gate Keeper team!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.290
You were amazing, lady!

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:44.130
You lifted our bus!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.930
I bet she's an Olympic athlete!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.030
Stupid! She's better than that!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.980
The enemy completely fell for it.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.200
Reiko, are you ready?!

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.580
I'm all set!

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:04.640
Now, to play
Bewitching Melody, No.4!

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:08.050
Oh... I don't have the music sheets.

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:12.230
No, you can't!!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:16.800
That's true... I can't forget
things like that, can l?

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:18.330
Let's see now...

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:21.760
I found them!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.370
Now, I can play!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.840
Huh?

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:28.300
We have to stop him somehow!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.570
Megane, isn't the gate
engine here yet?!

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:34.010
<i>It was being serviced, so we lost
time loading it into the container.'</i>

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:37.710
<i>We need 30... no,
20 minutes more!</i>

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.090
Argh! Why is this thing
so damned heavy?!

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:44.260
Hurry it up, Bancho!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:47.090
Shut up, punk!! You're the last
person I want ordering me around!

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:50.090
<i>No matter how powerfull
the gate engine...</i>

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.660
<i>without flexible mobility,
it 's just a piece of fancy junk.</i>

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:02.600
Damn! Rurippe, back me up!
I'll get as close as I can...

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.740
...and hurl a
Vacuous missile at it!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:07.180
- Roger!
- It won't work!

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:10.330
Even I was nearly crushed by it.

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.990
You can't possibly win
against something like that!

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.720
That may be true.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.160
Then give up!

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:21.220
Still, Ukiya may not look it,
but he's surprisingly reliable.

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:23.650
Let's do it! Vacuous...

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.200
...missile!

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:29.170
Rats! It'll have to be
close combat after all!

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.000
Rurippe, where are you?!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.540
Herel am!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.400
Great! Now's my chance!

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:39.980
<i>I see him!</i>

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.040
Ukiya !

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.050
Hi!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:48.780
Don't "hi" me! Honestly!
You aren't reliable at all!

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.220
About what?

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:51.820
Nothing in particular.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.690
More important,
I found his weak point!

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.860
All I have to do now is hit
it with a Vacuous m...

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:04.470
You can do it, Ukiya!

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:07.310
It's not just you...

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:08.470
Hm?

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:10.170
I wanted to...

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:12.980
...to try harder!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.910
<i>Kaoru got first place again!</i>

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:18.280
<i>Takaya practiced so much after
school, but she still lost again.</i>

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:19.440
<i>She can 't help it.</i>

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:22.460
<i>Kaoru always comes in first.
She doesn 't have to practice.</i>

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:26.460
I loved running, I loved physical
exercise, more than anyone.

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:29.360
So l only wanted to try hard
just like everybody else...

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:31.460
...but they told me
I didn't qualify.

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:33.400
I thoughtl could get
closer to my dream...

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:35.870
...if l ran faster
than anybody else!

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:38.510
Oh, you poor thing.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:41.870
I understand why you
want to run away.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.640
You're wrong!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:46.840
I didn't run away!
I quit track because...

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.350
I quit because...

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.950
I've been through a lot,
but I always loved piano...

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:57.980
...ever since I was a child,
and I still play it now.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.730
We don't have a chance!
Let's pull back!

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:08.470
No! Look at Kaoru.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.510
She mastered her gate
without depending on props!

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:13.200
I should be able to as well!

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:15.410
But that's...!

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:22.540
<i>Concentrate. You must concentrate!</i>

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:32.190
RUN!!!

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:44.200
Kaoru?

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:47.210
I decided to try a little
harder again like everyone else...

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:49.330
...without running away!

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.340
One more time...
...to the very end!

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.380
All right!

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:57.540
GATE...

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:00.040
...OPEN!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:19.410
You did it, Ukiya!

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:28.940
You did good, Kaoru.

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:31.680
What's wrong?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:36.210
This is the first time anyone
ever praised me for doing well.

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:43.360
- Good morning!
- You're early today.

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:45.560
Ukiya!

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:52.300
Good morning, Ukiya!

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:57.080
The Tategami high school
uniform looks good on you.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:03.580
I heard how the athletic teams
immediately started fighting over you.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.850
It must be difficult
to turn them all down.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:09.080
Not really. After all, I can't
compete in a track meet.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:09.680
Oh, yeah.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:13.390
Come on, Ukiya!
Don't look so gloomy!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:17.590
By doing Earth Defense work
I can run and jump all I want!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:21.320
Besides, I found a new goal!

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:23.030
What is it?

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:25.840
It's a race that can't
be won by strength alone!

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:28.030
See you later!

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.980
Can't be won...
...by strength alone?

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:33.610
Ikusawa!

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:36.310
You won't beat me!

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:40.920
What's she talking about?

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:42.890
Well, if she doesn't
want you to win...

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:45.520
...maybe it's an eating contest
or a booger length battle.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.460
Hey!
Huh?

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:55.730
IDIOT!!!

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:08.450
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:12.320
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:17.290
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:20.660
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:20.660 --> 00:22:22.800
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:27.970
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:31.310
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:31.310 --> 00:22:35.940
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:36.650 --> 00:22:40.810
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:45.450
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:52.220
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
